    - target: {fileID: 8881028038475493880, guid: fd28f23af44f73f4a95e33435872ad15, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "Crewmate - Captain! The ship's AI... It's gone rogue! \n\nYou have
        to make it to the bridge and disable it, quick before its too ... \n\nMysterious
        Voice - Hello Captain, i've dealt with your little 'crew' and you're next.
        Good luck getting to me. I've locked all the doors\n\n**************End Transmission**************\n\nYou
        - This is NOT good! I need to get to the brig, maybe I can put a stop to
        this. The override button must be around here somewhere."
