    - target: {fileID: 8881028038475493880, guid: fd28f23af44f73f4a95e33435872ad15, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'Ai - Ahh Captain, what a lovely surprise


        Captain - Wait...
        you''re an Ai?!


        Ai - Caught red-handed, I took over your ship months
        ago, slowly biding my time and taking over more and more systems.


        Captain
        - You''ve been on this ship for months?! How did you get past our firewall?


        Ai
        - Oh your systems are very out of date, sneaking in was childs play! It''s
        time to die captain.


        Captain - I need to shut down the systems
        to flush it out, the shutdown button is in the next room but its locked the
        doors, I''ll need to find the three emergency release buttons'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
